      "title": "Independent facility reference",
      "url": "https://www.adnu.edu.ph/college-of-law/wp-content/uploads/sites/34/2022/07/2022-AdNU-COL-Manual.pdf",
      "note": "Official 2022 main-campus map, printed p. 4 (PDF p. 9), inspected directly: red covered-walk network around the quadrangle, library/halls, gym and northern court. Draft roof strips follow corresponding existing OSM footways, clipped around buildings and carriageways; widths and heights remain estimates. Existing Ignatius, Pieta and Immaculate Concepcion parks, six parking areas, tennis courts and three guard-house footprints are retained without duplication. Remove the unsupported isolated canopy across the central lawn. Four Pillars exact architectural placement remains unresolved. The name Bonoan Walk is now supported by the separately inspected current OSM area, described below. This is the Bagumbayan campus, not Pacol. The owner-supplied annotated Google Maps overhead image was inspected separately for the landcover vegetation correction on 2026-10-02; it does not establish current roof coverage or an imagery date. No timeline dates are inferred."
    },
    {
      "title": "OpenStreetMap: Bonoan Walk",
      "url": "https://www.openstreetmap.org/way/221806198",
      "note": "Primary OSM API inspected on 2026-10-02. The named area lies inside the Bagumbayan campus along the authored covered footway 222412317 between the southern halls and quadrangle. OSM tags the named strip as residential landuse, which establishes the mapped name/location, not its roof coverage; the official 2022 campus map separately supports the covered walkway. Do not confuse this area with the Bonoan campus in Pacol."
    }
